\ wname.fam — names for the wallet (docs/GUI_WALLET.md, phase 2;
\ docs/NAMES.md), as tabminer's names.rs, name_trie.rs and wallet.rs: a
\ name's rules and key; a registration's owner key, salt, commit and memo
\ from a nonce; the operations (commit, reveal, update) as a transaction
\ carries them and their digests; a transaction of the wallet's carrying
\ operations (inputs, change, the operations) signed; a name's trie proof
\ checked against a state root.  After wkeys.fam, xsign.fam and
\ wslate.fam; state.fam's words for names (nhash, keyof, rvalue,
\ opdigest, tlhash, kbit, kprefix, dfl) with buffers of its own (wninit:
\ the wallet loads no connect.fam, whose stinit allocates them).  Digests
\ are Montgomery words unless said canonical (bytes, as a block or the
\ API carries them).
\
\ wninit  the buffers (once).
\ wnok ( a n -- flag )  1 to 32 characters of a-z, 0-9, _.
\ wnkey ( a n k -- )  k (4 words, least significant first) = its key.
\ wnhash ( a n c -- )  c = its hash.
\ wnown ( c -- )  c = the owner hash of the nonce in wkn (its key in wnxk,
\ its public key, 49 bytes, at wnpub).
\ wnsalt ( c -- )  c = the commit salt of the nonce in wkn.
\ wnmemo ( dst -- )  the name memo of the nonce in wkn: 32 canonical
\ bytes (the output memo, then zeros: a memo slot of amount zero).
\ wncom ( nh salt owner c -- )  c = the commit hash.
\ wnrec ( name n owner value memo dst -- len )  a record's bytes (owner,
\ value and memo canonical, 32 bytes each).
\ wnupdm ( rec c -- )  c = the message an update to rec is signed over.
\ wncop ( commit memo dst -- n )  a commit operation's bytes (the commit
\ canonical; the memo its 20 bytes).
\ wnrop ( rec salt pos dst -- n )  a reveal's (salt canonical; pos the
\ commit's position, 8 bytes).
\ wnuop ( rec leaf dst -- n )  an update's, signed by the key in wnxk
\ (wnown of the current owner's nonce first) at the leaf.
\ wnopd ( op c -- )  c = an operation's digest (as the body has it).
\ A transaction carrying operations: wcbeg; wcin+ ( pk amt -- ) an input;
\ wcout+ ( out -- ) an output (60 bytes); wcop+ ( op n -- ) an
\ operation; wcbody ( c -- ) its id; wctx ( keys leaves poss -- n ) it
\ signed at wctb (keys: XMSS keys' addresses, leaves: words, poss:
\ 8-byte positions, one each per input).
\ A proof (the caller sets wnpk the key, wnpt the terminal: 0 none, 1 a
\ leaf with key wnptk and value wnptv; wnpn siblings at wnps, from the
\ terminal up; wnpor the outputs half's root, wnpsr the state root):
\ wnmem ( value -- flag ) the key holds value; wnabs ( -- flag ) it is
\ absent.

: wnb variable ;  : wnd variable ;  : wnxk variable ;  : wnpub variable ;  : wnks variable ;  : wnent variable ;
: wna1 variable ;  : wna2 variable ;  : wna3 variable ;  : wna4 variable ;  : wna5 variable ;  : wna6 variable ;
: wninit
wsinit xkinit
wnb @ 0= if
	60 lit alloc wnb !  20 lit alloc wnd !  4 lit xksize alloc wnxk !  34 lit alloc wnpub !  20 lit alloc wnks !  8 lit alloc wnent !
	\ state.fam's, as stinit would
	nel @ 0= if 80 lit alloc nel !  80 lit alloc nin !  10 lit alloc nkey !  60 lit alloc ob ! then
	tha @ 0= if 40 lit alloc tha !  40 lit alloc thb ! then
	tz @ 0= if 10 lit alloc tz !  10 lit alloc tmpk !  10 lit alloc tkp ! then
	dflt @ 0= if
		520 lit alloc dflt !  dflt @ 8 lit wzero
		28 lit 0 lit do i dfl i dfl i 1 lit + dfl compress loop
	then
then ;

: wnok  name-ok ;
: wnhash  nhash ;
: wnkey  wna1 !  wnd @ nhash  wnd @ wna1 @ keyof ;
: wnown
wna1 !
33 lit wnd @ wkwith  wnd @ wnks @ wkcan
wnks @ 4 lit wnxk @ xkgen  wnxk @ wnpub @ xkpub
wnpub @ wna1 @ wkpkh ;
: wnsalt  34 lit swap wkwith ;
: wnmemo  dup wkmemo  14 lit + C lit 0 lit do 0 lit over i + c! loop drop ;
: wncom
wna4 !  wna3 !  wna2 !  wna1 !
wna1 @ wnb @ 8 lit wcopy  wna2 @ wnb @ 20 lit + 8 lit wcopy  wna3 @ wnb @ 40 lit + 8 lit wcopy
wnb @ 18 lit 7 lit wna4 @ hdom ;
: wnrec
wna6 !  wna5 !  wna4 !  wna3 !  wna2 !  wna1 !
wna2 @ wna6 @ c!  wna1 @ wna6 @ 1 lit + wna2 @ bcopy
wna3 @ wna6 @ 1 lit + wna2 @ + 20 lit bcopy
wna4 @ wna6 @ 21 lit + wna2 @ + 20 lit bcopy
wna5 @ wna6 @ 41 lit + wna2 @ + 20 lit bcopy
wna2 @ 61 lit + ;
: wnuc variable ;
: wnupdm  wnuc !  wnd @ rvalue  wnd @ 8 lit A lit wnuc @ hdom ;
\ The operations' bytes.
: wncop
wna3 !  wna2 !  wna1 !
1 lit wna3 @ c!  wna1 @ wna3 @ 1 lit + 20 lit bcopy  wna2 @ wna3 @ 21 lit + 14 lit bcopy  35 lit ;
: wnrl  c@ 61 lit + ;                           \ ( rec -- len )
: wnrop
wna4 !  wna3 !  wna2 !  wna1 !
2 lit wna4 @ c!  wna1 @ wna4 @ 1 lit + wna1 @ wnrl bcopy
wna3 @ wna4 @ 1 lit + wna1 @ wnrl + 5 lit bcopy
wna2 @ wna4 @ 6 lit + wna1 @ wnrl + 20 lit bcopy
wna1 @ wnrl 26 lit + ;
: wnuop
wna3 !  wna2 !  wna1 !
3 lit wna3 @ c!  wna1 @ wna3 @ 1 lit + wna1 @ wnrl bcopy
wnpub @ wna3 @ 1 lit + wna1 @ wnrl + 31 lit bcopy
wna1 @ wnb @ wnupdm
wnxk @ wnb @ 8 lit wna2 @ wna3 @ 32 lit + wna1 @ wnrl + xksign
wna1 @ wnrl 32 lit + 908 lit + ;
: wnopd  swap dup c@ wnent @ !  1 lit + wnent @ 4 lit + !  wnent @ swap opdigest ;

\ ── A transaction carrying operations ──

: wcin variable ;  : wcnin variable ;  : wcout variable ;  : wcnout variable ;  : wcops variable ;  : wcopt variable ;
: wcnop variable ;  : wcend variable ;  : wctb variable ;  : wcbb variable ;  : wch variable ;  : wcp variable ;
: wcks variable ;  : wclv variable ;  : wcps variable ;
: wcbeg
wcin @ 0= if 400 lit alloc wcin !  200 lit alloc wcout !  4000 lit alloc wcops !  80 lit alloc wcopt !
	8000 lit alloc wctb !  800 lit alloc wcbb !  20 lit alloc wch ! then
0 lit wcnin !  0 lit wcnout !  0 lit wcnop !  0 lit wcend ! ;
: wcin+  wcin @ wcnin @ 39 lit * + 31 lit + 8 lit bcopy  wcin @ wcnin @ 39 lit * + 31 lit bcopy  wcnin @ 1 lit + wcnin ! ;
: wcout+  wcout @ wcnout @ 3C lit * + 3C lit bcopy  wcnout @ 1 lit + wcnout ! ;
: wcop+
wna2 !  wna1 !
wcend @ wcopt @ wcnop @ 3 lit lshift + !  wna2 @ wcopt @ wcnop @ 3 lit lshift + 4 lit + !
wna1 @ wcops @ wcend @ + wna2 @ bcopy  wcend @ wna2 @ + wcend !  wcnop @ 1 lit + wcnop ! ;
: wcopa  3 lit lshift wcopt @ + @ wcops @ + ;   \ ( i -- a )
: wcopn  3 lit lshift wcopt @ + 4 lit + @ ;     \ ( i -- n )
\ wcbody ( c -- )  the body hash (transaction.rs's body_elements): the
\ counts, each input's key and amount, each output's commitment, amount,
\ zeros and memo slot, each operation's digest.
: wcbody
wcbb @ vp !  wcnin @ v,  wcnout @ v,  wcnop @ v,  0 lit v,  4 lit 0 lit do 0 lit v, loop
wcnin @ ?dup if 0 lit do
	wcin @ i 39 lit * +  dup vd,  dup 20 lit + 4 lit 0 lit do dup i 2 lit lshift + le@ v, loop drop  31 lit + vamount  0 lit v,
loop then
wcnout @ ?dup if 0 lit do
	wcout @ i 3C lit * +
	dup wch @ wsocom  wch @ vp @ 8 lit wcopy  vp @ 20 lit + vp !
	dup 20 lit + vamount  5 lit 0 lit do 0 lit v, loop
	dup 28 lit + 5 lit 0 lit do dup i 2 lit lshift + le@ v, loop drop  20 lit + vamount
loop then
wcnop @ ?dup if 0 lit do
	vp @ wcp !  i wcopa wcp @ wnopd  wcp @ 20 lit + vp !
loop then
wcbb @ vp @ wcbb @ - 2 lit rshift 3 lit 3 lit pick hdom drop ;
: wctx
wcps !  wclv !  wcks !
wch @ wcbody  wch @ wnb @ 8 lit wcopy
wctb @ wcp !  wcnin @ wcp @ wkle!  wcp @ 4 lit + wcp !
wcnin @ ?dup if 0 lit do
	wcin @ i 39 lit * +  dup wcp @ 39 lit bcopy  wcp @ 39 lit + wcp !
	wcps @ i 3 lit lshift + wcp @ 8 lit bcopy  wcp @ 8 lit + wcp !
	wcks @ i 2 lit lshift + @ wnb @ 8 lit wclv @ i 2 lit lshift + @ wcp @ xksign
	30 lit + c@ 44 lit + 5 lit lshift 8 lit + wcp @ + wcp !
loop then
0 lit wcp @ wkle!  wcnout @ wcp @ 4 lit + wkle!  wcp @ 8 lit + wcp !
wcout @ wcp @ wcnout @ 3C lit * bcopy  wcp @ wcnout @ 3C lit * + wcp !
wcnop @ wcp @ wkle!  wcp @ 4 lit + wcp !
wcops @ wcp @ wcend @ bcopy  wcp @ wcend @ + wcp !
wcp @ wctb @ - ;

\ ── A name's trie proof ──

: wnpk variable ;  : wnpt variable ;  : wnptk variable ;  : wnptv variable ;  : wnps variable ;  : wnpn variable ;
: wnpor variable ;  : wnpsr variable ;  : wnq1 variable ;  : wnq2 variable ;  : wnr variable ;
: wnpini
wnpk @ 0= if 10 lit alloc wnpk !  10 lit alloc wnptk !  20 lit alloc wnptv !  F00 lit alloc wnps !  20 lit alloc wnpor !
	20 lit alloc wnpsr !  10 lit alloc wnq1 !  10 lit alloc wnq2 !  20 lit alloc wnr ! then ;
\ wnroot ( c -- )  c = the root the proof implies for wnpk's path.
: wnroot
wna1 !
wnpt @ 0= if
	wnpn @ if wna1 @ 8 lit wzero else 27 lit dfl wna1 @ 8 lit wcopy then
else wnptk @ wnptv @ wna1 @ tlhash then
wnpn @ ?dup if 0 lit do
	wnpn @ 1 lit - i - wna2 !
	wnps @ i 5 lit lshift + wna3 !
	wnpk @ wna2 @ kbit if wna3 @ wna1 @ wna1 @ compress else wna1 @ wna3 @ wna1 @ compress then
loop then ;
\ wnstok ( -- flag )  the implied root, with the outputs half's, the state
\ root; the path no deeper than a key.
: wnstok  wnr @ wnroot  wnpor @ wnr @ wnr @ compress  wnr @ wnpsr @ d=  wnpn @ 79 lit u< and ;
: wnkeq  -1 lit 4 lit 0 lit do 2 lit pick i w@ 2 lit pick i w@ = and loop nip nip ;   \ ( a b -- flag )
: wnmem
wna5 !
wnpt @ 1 lit =  wnptk @ wnpk @ wnkeq and  wnptv @ wna5 @ d= and
dup if drop wnstok then ;
: wnabs
wnpt @ 0= if -1 lit else
	wnptk @ wnpk @ wnkeq 0=
	wnptk @ wnpn @ wnq1 @ kprefix  wnpk @ wnpn @ wnq2 @ kprefix  wnq1 @ wnq2 @ wnkeq and
then
dup if drop wnstok then ;
